{"id": "34203", "title": "七日情种(黑寡妇1)", "author": "白双", "category": "文学名著", "count": 46, "available": 12, "cover": "files/article/image/34/34203/34203s.jpg", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/34/34203.htm", "intro": "为了让一个男人死心，付出的代价竟是──与全天下女人为敌。她的「坏女人因子」百分百！迷惑男人的魅力、技巧、手段一级棒，从公司主任、总经理的男友、企业小开都曾为她着迷。想不到最后却栽在这总裁手里，不仅被拥护他的娘子军泼水威吓、还出手围殴她。冤枉呀！她都还没「出手」,哪来的「勾引」？何况他握有她的把柄,躲都来不及了！……耍手段、贪图虚荣、玩弄男人感情……？他最排斥的女人特质,显然她都具备了，若不是有一笔生意需要靠她「超级业务员」的手腕来挽救。他也用不着把她带在身边七天,还要时时防备她的「追求」，只是防不胜防,最后一天竟「失守」了！四岁的孩子？该不会是那天她借「情」偷了「种」吧！……", "base": "files/article/html/34/34203", "chapters": [{"title": "楔子", "file": "2173103.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第1页", "file": "2173104.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第2页", "file": "2173105.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第3页", "file": "2173106.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第4页", "file": "2173107.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第5页", "file": "2173108.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第6页", "file": "2173109.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第7页", "file": "2173110.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第8页", "file": "2173111.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第9页", "file": "2173112.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第10页", "file": "2173113.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第11页", "file": "2173114.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第12页", "file": "2173115.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第13页", "file": "2173116.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第14页", "file": "2173117.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第15页", "file": "2173118.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第16页", "file": "2173119.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第17页", "file": "2173120.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第18页", "file": "2173121.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第19页", "file": "2173122.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第20页", "file": "2173123.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第21页", "file": "2173124.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第22页", "file": "2173125.html", "availab